  4. Revocation of registration and suspension of business of logistics warehousing business entities under Article 17(1) of the Act applicable mutatis mutandis in Article 21-10 of the Act;
  5.
  [Previous subparagraph 5 moved to subparagraph 1-2. <Jul. 19, 2022>]
